@host = http://localhost:5201
@apiKey = postman-dev-key

### Health probe (anonymous)
GET {{host}}/healthz

### Send to dev group "bugs" topic
POST {{host}}/api/notify
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "destination": "familytree.dev.bugs",
  "text": "NullReferenceException at AccountService:42"
}

### Send to dev group "general" (no TopicId on destination)
POST {{host}}/api/notify
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "destination": "familytree.dev.general",
  "text": "Manual ping from Postman"
}

### Send to main group (X-Api-Key header form)
POST {{host}}/api/notify
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "destination": "main.group",
  "text": "Salom asosiy gruppa"
}

### Send to main channel with HTML
POST {{host}}/api/notify
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "destination": "main.channel",
  "text": "<b>Yangi versiya</b> chiqdi.",
  "parseMode": "HTML",
  "disableNotification": true
}

### Unknown destination -> 404
POST {{host}}/api/notify
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "destination": "does.not.exist",
  "text": "should fail"
}

### Missing API key -> 401
POST {{host}}/api/notify
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "destination": "familytree.dev.bugs",
  "text": "should be rejected"
}

### Wrong API key -> 401
POST {{host}}/api/notify
Authorization: Bearer wrong-key
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "destination": "familytree.dev.bugs",
  "text": "should be rejected"
}
